    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle</h2>A large number of enemies are attacking you, while ensuring survival, try to kill as many enemies as possible.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411660/extras/4fbc48a63c9aa6a7a8c82ed390f637f4.poster.avif?t=1684717743\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411660/extras/4fbc48a63c9aa6a7a8c82ed390f637f4.webm?t=1684717743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411660/extras/4fbc48a63c9aa6a7a8c82ed390f637f4.mp4?t=1684717743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Relic</h2>Upgrading gives you a chance to choose relics, and each upgrade randomly generates 5 different relics. Choose a unique combination of relics to make your character stronger<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411660/extras/218614f4903a3b630c540857838924bc.poster.avif?t=1684717743\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411660/extras/218614f4903a3b630c540857838924bc.webm?t=1684717743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411660/extras/218614f4903a3b630c540857838924bc.mp4?t=1684717743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade</h2>Use the gold coins obtained from each game to purchase enhancements, and the enhanced attributes will take effect in new battles. You can reset the enhancement at any time and switch to a different upgrade route<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411660/extras/4437a393a73c4edc3dd2833a9fedde34.poster.avif?t=1684717743\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411660/extras/4437a393a73c4edc3dd2833a9fedde34.webm?t=1684717743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
